 "notes": "The Scharendijke dive front on the inside of the Brouwersdam, west of the harbour Haven Kloosternol: the long steiger of the Kabbelaarsrif with its end platform and stone steps, the training platform at 9 m, and Le Serpent (sunk in 2011) on its buoys. This shows the main entry. Shoreline, steiger, buoys and wreck position from OpenStreetMap, descriptions from duikplaats.net; the site coordinates are the village centre, about 300 m south-west of the steiger.",
